# Review-flow suites the CURRENT self-review pin is known not to pass (test/ci/self-review-pin.sh), one per line:
#   <suite file name> <the 40-char pin sha> <the protection that is not in the pinned snapshot yet>
# Allowed only for that exact pin: a pin bump runs every suite against the new pin again. Keep this list empty whenever
# the newest reviewed main carries the protection — bump the pin instead (docs/self-review.md).
review-machinery-paths.sh 5f54f10b5372919fb5aca0c3f6e6cd59c957cd76 raw NUL-delimited, rename-free machinery paths (review of twitter-monitor 489ee563e #1) land on main first; the self-review pin bump follows
dev-review-superseded.sh 5f54f10b5372919fb5aca0c3f6e6cd59c957cd76 a reverted passing review no longer supersedes a blocked one (review of foxhole-backend b4d18dbbc #1) lands on main first; the self-review pin bump follows
